    "description": "AST-expansion conformance fixture for grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/godunov_upwind_D1y_extrapolate_bc: a minimal consuming model binding NX=NY=8 at the import edge (the smallest even size on which every region of the rule is non-empty). The match on the Godunov-upwind per-axis quantity max(D-y u, 0) - min(D+y u, 0) matched as D(u, wrt: y) (priority 10) fires through the section-9.6.3 fixpoint and lowers to the rule's body -- three regions: interior [1,8]x[2,7] and the two ghost wall lines j=1, j=8 -- with the imported stencils inlined, the free names dx, dy left symbolic, all metaparameters folded, zero apply_expression_template nodes, zero unlowered rewrite-target ops. x0=y0=0, dx=dy=1/8 spelled with the literal 8 (grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/grid.esm contract). The golden pins the byte-identical post-lowering AST across bindings.",
